2	Coast of Rameshwaram	Rameshwaram, Tamilnadu	India	October	2025	At 4500 meters, the air is thin and the silence is total. Ladakh strips everything away — no crowds, no noise, just stone monasteries clinging to cliff faces and the impossible blue of mountain lakes. I chased the golden hour light across the Nubra Valley for days before the clouds finally broke.	https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczM5u5Xus0YkM9uTsn8pvIs_-yiHooBuh_goZTi0VLp_J87fGaQgESnfAu9_9lYGYXHG7of4PehQ-PwFPw-Ml8bKKarDsUycGN0599bqydcwF8Cek-yV=w1200	27	["landscape","mountains","himalayas"]	f	https://photos.app.goo.gl/1FsnEv6BPzApn4JC7	[]	\N	["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNb7MnxAkooDMCa8XpwyWko7C5GZf3sBlsuDnwSXj8Q-VuJFrtpfrEx9MIMPItAQ-rLQtKhEsJ5E1HxfI5nPjAhV1jtUXjjclwJQd_yMW8cZ9IzpwsT=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPVjJMVBP54cH2XXDgqbBxx43NEu15Zlc0Qb-xhyFqpOqptsDM7eGUWcTg8q4JxuMDxp_JncIa3Vl3SKOOxPTpyhaAqI1lmylkjkwDfubKe4P6EyM_d=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNa1Hf0TGezoH8ec-W2cUCpT_aug2GrpfNdG6QAzKEMVke-qksip5hxmefOGSPRMUST1_A1oHqBx5r5F4McPse1Pwefob9Tyf-5VwDM8FeeVxYVFlO-=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNihGOxF18oBztbRTdA3uB6t79nka3xazqIhwpUwl8JS65oHp16H8uoSsym38U1BNbx46Fvy3FPWJq-pZDKp65tFdVv4FbdnWqMAXiYtCXynaPoocyJ=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNBF3UgEKYLBiOxjNYju1136LbN0o7r_dW5T3mkZRFUHSTHa1WnMcxLeLrUSHo5AqvFz-AVw1YcksQdBLoUOLaJWJYo4Fx4_rhrmbSAfNxewsFG8I0O=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPkfGoS32tjiUCVOyupRSNlKnHBXkH1SIA595gwMk1DbGNgH17zgbe-yQmyozr6r6z7IpGDJ8wjSyWpdd_QlpzK6zMAweoYyAvkzdsK2fJLhqI2mFQu=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPDPBy7ayI-eG7UHFHsKiY1iqQiXJ9e2L0XELPZ9dbU5QoMc5t6KVOpv6ZiJD_JzB3-scSLR6Dc8y5h_cjXtzY2Any8iW1pDrXNkelFS_YoDqDE2e1w=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNR4fYw05OTbaLtPPOBsX2PH9oaZxlPHXnrEeOhRq2NL8P-p8sbERn9wsZKU3KnV56qq-ljJ4ZvhGgtN9PQnSg8wjwk20I0WI0ASheLKQrLhCRn-TjK=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNcAYmn6