5	Valparai - Tea and Lion tailed macaques	Valparai, Tamil Nadu	India	February	2025	Svalbard in March is a world of blue light and frozen silence. The polar bears here are enormous — sea ice hunters who regard you with flat predatory calm. I tracked a mother and two cubs across pack ice for four days, staying close enough to photograph but always with a rifle-equipped guide at my side. The midnight sun turns everything amber.	https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOHpQph1tR3ceR9aUHwbhs0ZxkTNQmm8HSWd6ntK5aoBeqyJwqeISv_yZmcrMIV58izw1Lm8OgGtgksyShQSY54a0NjQqEndSF9i0KA8e76SL11lCQU=w1200	30	["arctic","wildlife","polar bears"]	f	https://photos.google.com/share/AF1QipPCdptJisbRvWGGevZpkap1gjHfRtEZR_2xZ8lZmXiMAqVMDunkOM7AMVIC6sTUdA?key=MjkzazhPMU5zR2ExeGotb2pTa2V6dlYzVXRjNDJB	[]	\N	["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOHpQph1tR3ceR9aUHwbhs0ZxkTNQmm8HSWd6ntK5aoBeqyJwqeISv_yZmcrMIV58izw1Lm8OgGtgksyShQSY54a0NjQqEndSF9i0KA8e76SL11lCQU=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMboNHkg6H6DjnLJyM4lAcck07bjdzeFmO7gBbcDwc89SeN713noLBymhvFPiVWF2nG8vJoloSV8AJqtbN-SiTQ3D1a23IRczUWmLmBkfbzz0Ll2sNS=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP47O2kMNVdELm1-9t3IhMOOJDBPBngWQxApHtUwpjmRWOdQQwpBnZVFZwx6Cva4XrCwyXTAkp_Vl-Edk5tg02vo5LOasAY1M3iPN_WXb_24pa5SseW=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFq6448JdF1QOrFoOucLaPVkF66BumnYqIMpx5zYnhBk9O9JQ0MCxQX65udp1AwjTF5IZsRsDsyTXcMC9hV5q6FU6DWCkQ_uUK_NDsrxcRQV9UTBSL=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPSsexxVgH2eV7BOu4BuLuOx86L0aTKEO7JL9vdkdlYnI7R7sCmqNp_0I-unyq4PQ3CfVba8F7EeTSggPnNi9Hvq8311LTgma7NZeWufmgywjDqCf15=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPmu_S4-hke3RNZxe92KVSgM71GDzVzUMJV6qF16fSiO_BIas9dp84--O8afaJ-dzG_05z5roP4BlNpkm01BsrzdcpRs2yfRumLbbJW5Pc9FHie0V7I=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOUcUbqWMbOXa6QS9xi_T8mXpFgJfK3dKegyqzpKwioLkssUf_DT-9d_PE_1dfSslwVhDHfwL4nSQvY949qKp3CEFhHDknuepgXcsHqCoDvrcfhfI32=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNrXLP