18	Color Bombs of Ratnagiri	Ratnagiri, Maharashtra	India	September	2024	Every October, polar bears gather on the shores of Hudson Bay near the small town of Churchill, waiting for the ice to form. I photographed from a specially built tundra buggy — a raised vehicle that lets you get close without disturbing the bears. The bears are curious and often approach the vehicle, sometimes rearing up to look in the windows.	https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPbSt17yxY1Ns4sdO1g_eQephiiFT_NvhAPG3GWAGQNhNlWSzzLZBD8uXVpJgAGb3_gq4P5E-uogZwBvAtVRGuxE7NRFp_UIfO0FZwNSr6rne0h8Lri=w1200	109	["wildlife","polar bears","arctic"]	f	https://photos.google.com/share/AF1QipPKmYfgwNsPr7G09k-CKgVe8RaZvJNBJattEdc8YmX5lIoqHEyVtUBBJkscitALLw?key=Wkthb2J2WGJieU1tRFNRLWdXYUZTeEdqRTRwa2Nn	[]	\N	["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPbSt17yxY1Ns4sdO1g_eQephiiFT_NvhAPG3GWAGQNhNlWSzzLZBD8uXVpJgAGb3_gq4P5E-uogZwBvAtVRGuxE7NRFp_UIfO0FZwNSr6rne0h8Lri=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNQlCrUhKlbXWG5Jc7nmG27QgpDV1qeZ45TEf5I7zsdrwU2151OJkDL3oZY8idKt8wuGcIfMipmWnjWK5QJzETRfS76pGaSkwpiHdfe3i8hs8URkGNl=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMSdZqU0y0Q_Yl2pM1hwpS-zVwR4JjFWGObEFxgYupRA_l6vbeyD1FilGOMkwypDkKU_xsS5xvxtdEQj55nl4XlDVXroWhdmtK_EQYl4mzp0PrE4sZL=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPZdFkRKINs9SqL4lm8vuJuLmApguSy1SrKGKBdaFYb9w1_Ah-aRZJSD5rHKw5l8pRfHohlzhHZWdJnQIhirUcXI4uoOs4kS4KHNgVN0HOBFWCL85iQ=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNQgCURcwZQ3Wih5BLKhBQFrwKLik22-U4dKa0RCzIUAAaabAd9M3Q0-1FyzJGRcMaNlEww1k68OCB-OMdOJaBn4cXWahrWi-ohusB9JhlCQJbkf-3F=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMloGbI6Iom7pLyZ_46XLsA1Tn_Y5IwZmWChuCK2xfdGOSy78QENnmSEpPUHW0LlvVpL2isktafWMbFO2PIFyEMBuJPrdH6m8ftTaVl_7HODTUJc84Y=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNUNFk8k3iYxJ8SYsSGKyHNgElbmqOOTINh5YiA4WOFSFGzmfAxjYphyHBxs-Zz5Zy0qZjhlY7oaQvPUV2TEAuALxQ2HGpJf3cTo6DJDlB-_gI6qG0G=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNtRVs-fmNqgry