19	Jim Corbett	Corbett National Park, Uttar Pradesh	India	March	2025	Yala National Park in Sri Lanka has one of the highest densities of leopards in the world, yet they remain spectacularly difficult to photograph. I spent four days doing six-hour safari drives at dawn and dusk, scanning every rock outcrop and tree. On the fourth evening, a large male descended from a granite boulder twenty meters from our jeep and walked directly toward us before veering into the scrub.	https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczM5HrAcXjJIwb51-KLSVcUPfGVmYvlwPy42A6sSOixp4EKZuhpxP6sF-gLQCxsAGOypciFlvE361MufVWiklg5KEa6S4Zxv89ApG8GAHBjbW-2q71kw=w1920	41	["wildlife","leopards","jungle"]	f	https://photos.app.goo.gl/kzSdVKric2qDQhAV9	[]	\N	["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczM5HrAcXjJIwb51-KLSVcUPfGVmYvlwPy42A6sSOixp4EKZuhpxP6sF-gLQCxsAGOypciFlvE361MufVWiklg5KEa6S4Zxv89ApG8GAHBjbW-2q71kw=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczO88_-SO5yWEla4MTz6QJUMGP4aiK1s0bttzyJYbkOaOeJL4IpEr24jeh0AiXlMSq4UG6ZjXYEpnY_Jk23hbH6RBmtr4RxeTaMJXJmwRvpaCDzzTway=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOS-OoKrKwo8bWOpn0UAkiacYqb8YxPWo3W92c6_aVwzrL3IL3jRITXmYRNNADpOzIQcFmBC7BkE717kDS41Wp1E1fg8UbqqfjvPJ06ISJ4n7d6ljv4=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP23BFJS-21YJlYdKzk7ymhZt9AcP5twNACCQj4SzswjE6qDpKWEXfaeb5jjw_pyRdLYoorVXS8o3LaFf2mC1GOBzFcqDEtTM_VEEKe3Wj3McEuRwsz=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMTEf2lB5dTENwFfKn5zK3zRnYK0HXYckclb-Mbw0DAoXqX7mi-0xZrEJExTO0LhFjJIe7MK9ZAiUkZgcHGd2o0eAb0FwPm5spVCT4J2llT-NLPzFIz=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNFRk7m_TAfvOqDOCiEoRfbmLjBjqwCKBbSwqv8EOGYBZWHbxFr-HRGEB_m_nYnNPJMku2q7RGCkHCdaCcvmlpwJv7v1Mn8y4jcPxBtrF80MxkSL02C=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP2vTymQFf56w3Bt7Lk5EpW1sqi3IhfkO8-q0pPqHaL50aidT3clb-tq9VkUFSDLnsNanOyPvxv2nrJZvfXpo13CStDYOuW6tbO-Q5uWFVVRLN1Berk=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOPW2IxRy8jX9ZwCxNjB2vvzB83PTVUXAm0julL-Lpf0_uRQxazvyzTLDK1k9-4DIO