1	Colorful birds from the Himalayan foothills	Manda, Chopta and Sattal, Uttarakhand	India	March	2025	Witnessing the great wildebeest migration across the Serengeti plains is unlike anything else on Earth. Thousands of animals thundering through golden grass, dust rising in columns, crocodiles lurking at the river crossings. I spent three weeks camped on the banks of the Mara River, waiting for the exact moment the herd summoned the courage to cross. When it finally happened, the ground shook.	https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOuhNFdUODfz4zADEoGPpnoCr6RQW2Z3PchNFm8wXW0sxrMPAK0livXZa5igzcLufamu3tzlOpn7W4niQaCn1xQYD3zYtXljPpHQJln5WjtPbdi3Y3X=w1200	190	["wildlife","safari","migration"]	f	https://photos.google.com/share/AF1QipNm01XIccxzMpLTHHB-2LXxaLOlEhcZAuHteXWxHGV748nbLxNRIN5alH0dQQvaKw?key=X2R2UmZralpNQXhGTHNtWlB5QVVtdWp5TlFmd1d3	[]	\N	["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPQ3EjMs6ly_dUB0eiwaVRPs7wKs3GxZm9YjMBlAtd-XghpBI21SsoxJ_ClmF93DXTYA1Y_35ZDDx8mnzTY1vgHt0X3TQnTpCaIeZnlub_aBRhyfdaX=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOjs8KkTdE67hBTvAyfx1FVO_UEjW9CAHnhheRPzgd1XyvrlDxNt813t06fVFTAnPZ_Zcq5gdrFIdzFdJD_-g2XMHp3cgUtfth18zkt4Tpd4QigYAPY=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPcPchAtnJnQFFZUBSsdYWqs7I5yAlD6D_RvboWJspTuR-3v2CK6Mmvy3kErqNJREvwenbTEZUPEbf5mGz1f-sYfrkKvuYZHXDNw2lOeDrf5RQK_9No=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPjXU2O1C5VvZXelGcgflB-VDKe9bsIZ3QXe-FGte-0zGugDThII_UjMWbCSiBIk3xKJPAV5SlkqZrrctySCjFCZ9mi7wPQbS3o1bB8aKV2ZGvDS0QO=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMorsdd9sXdK2dymzgSSVBidJk4HFMeM5krdZFShZ3bdsri4L17cat4jURLeCm0Y7RLNFTm5xpvnfLEFgwKn9RG7QWYsaVge55PwIXZL4FBFS75z9uY=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMjEV35XaH3oT3KdmqZRVzq2Z1fGzwsExF0XMS7Yn9rViUJanqF4jgVKJ9xnXia-s3k9dnDU1X8dGPChmbh6N0iGdqj5Y47qsqO2s51QiyA-M1-b-yR=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNNJ4bN2GO4zaG4ZvW9IKjfh1M68DPrN2nCzGOlM593JSLL45JGr14s4d8_NR7gqbiNNIblmAkwa5npyxbT9dtO1T6KsrXyK7IIlpEZQ