16	Land of Rhinos	Kaziranga, Assam	India	December	2024	The Pantanal is the world's largest tropical wetland and the best place on Earth to see jaguars in the wild. Unlike their Amazonian cousins, Pantanal jaguars are relatively habituated to boats and can be photographed at close range along the riverbanks. I spent six days on a boat on the Cuiabá River and encountered fifteen different individuals, including a mother teaching her two cubs to hunt caiman.	https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOLYowST2soOmh0YEsQDumlHVMFDhptWzlTe6lh27y0qPqHBQLv9m20KyjSEq7JXlWbT_LR4z1PV7141BUce5ZEIVNruopYacYT7NOMGmnaxE3t6I-U=w1920	115	["wildlife","jaguars","wetlands"]	f	https://photos.app.goo.gl/ak8cQ7R4VfJtu7Ny8	["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPitj0m4zmw5QSVMHp2iU7w1LwCfmsOz4qolp0GqwQJka0KnhODhvXhsZ8keQPd6qLcy3ELe3gAxJMtEJRHUvO8RSfqJo21xM6XfstltDLVg9zn7dpt=w1920","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPcuDzMvxX__qXg307tUxWEYSqAHqegUWiJ7YPVa9vuuDLI4K8THVgn16RPJSwJElCpPD-bw0RaS6Typ8Yn0_8E56-0K30jINqhn-2YwfUy2I9DbExH=w1920","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMnY51ZZadHVlWWckORq9UwtumNHWox5WYQXU_5_XlFuUSU-h5fV8CimBfmlHtVpmwfD0L59I8sJWOlbpf0NV9flho-GJ5Snj8c5sfav-Jg6pWFPbip=w1920","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMU3513EfyfgwBWPoRqMQXsyCGEeyTlDSal9HjJXqO5alFIS3zdj67dnbAPuzt0BI-iKdzqMbfSGRkmmJ2z_Skl-fPhJBML7xGH2VFeFegAlFdgQUYk=w1920","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNUGp8bPpFcLTzHjfrgky_wpY4IdPCb3NA4QxXeejRrohznhVR_hLrWVKJInX6MIuFiistpMk-1GV0UITvRKzXehXKIkH-3_-iPHd_UbzSmuLLjuuIX=w1920","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPqo4s0seDcFiPexTLf91iP-YlW7bgtwMYr1iFr4AjdP-IYIhSFo-hiVtcXQ3NPqVBZoQOvfHtil_IEaf9vbS0lxCNgPL9j7MmeJ2U0hIT4uSySsAc8=w1920","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNR7897Kf5lYMrb5T0KkuOHreO_2_dmpu8oWtcjT8d9hzedgfsVVc58FrhRkH13L8EasHQPc7UeeFHK0uCI2O2T_HUwAskFhiJT7McDNLqJQB2jLsIj=w1920","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMUGY0B8n9f0J6sUTaaYdMAdUuE5Wf_SpGXI8NVIdbMyZPODYKU9VAP28TamEX67KKv8UTIgwPdEC2Fq0mNLsI