9	F2 and its Cubs from Gothangaon	Gothangaon, Maharashtra	India	June	2025	The Sundarbans is the only place on Earth where Bengal tigers swim between islands in the world's largest mangrove delta. Everything here is tidal and uncertain — the forest floods twice a day. I spent two weeks on a small wooden boat, watching the tree line for movement, camera ready. The tiger I finally photographed materialized from the roots like a dream and disappeared just as quickly.	https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOSWkv8ygk7qOG4wCKZBDZQSQHbWA618IcemAOTYIqJbkHyNZG_nc7iTpGI1C_UWXc-ZSvPCzH9l82qHsYQFVCZA6PeztNRnBH14P9QBmK_3nnA7Cwu=w1200	52	["wildlife","tigers","mangroves"]	f	https://photos.google.com/share/AF1QipPgHauC1iczyNc4aaA8gP2uGusQr27VaH5XVoWVYZZapOsNx3asQxUtcpVK6SFc4g?key=N0JWeHJ2a3NGaFJVNnVRYnk2VUJmVDZvM3pPQVh3	[]	\N	["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOSWkv8ygk7qOG4wCKZBDZQSQHbWA618IcemAOTYIqJbkHyNZG_nc7iTpGI1C_UWXc-ZSvPCzH9l82qHsYQFVCZA6PeztNRnBH14P9QBmK_3nnA7Cwu=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMAjlPAlFqJK0DsHTc9TbjAtk-Ic4fwI2fIDnykDu3QdnL83UU_ajdECCPTvp8K3JxPkalBahjZkyHx95xPOcXdupCH6jdBBIJxxBPZvQZgB-YUOCkU=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOQwe5wDQGgl-ptt2Zq4RCgCXPY88UpoPR6_Iu2XBIG1AHb7UGfpTAYhs2UEgaBksNxcrkI4P8J7TfFk7scPdWyo4gws6qaYz-eMmh-BrZftq60e0W6=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOwscpARt8nsE9aHNmcJbRyBQzS8rmycE0tTs7DUgNZyUr-t9tsknZSmrLKIhZZezXchTvqfHoDPqHgWgMGPOUGTM2l5NPLsa2I6zCMxDL6e-AT441m=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPV8WeGh78ooyOdfzzH_s2vEadDpsJQYr7pfe_5lZSonJjzCVgUtr84nnDN5ryjEG8hk7DRy-XoGV8rqU_MV4V8YJKaAbqUzmtsXokOJm3qKIQQRCJt=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNesaWj8Gd2khaEvC0HroCOF-btNICIv4itMnHCGny5XPd4Lfy9aOWR9R9fOVxLvBPTYsLTRT4e1M7-Wm0xCFL65d5VQe3yYn2VjF5VaYarblhDUWxR=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMDNrgwIaOzYLRv9c_Dan4eUCBogoevr5iDysqTYh1IfultY581lXaI2D5jefwMcCreWm69_bWk0oKJPGL8QcqIuZ3vE-hW2rk0S_z1bk2XQclmrotm=w1200","https://lh3