8	Gir - The land of asiatic Lions	Gir, Gujarat	india	January	2025	The dunes of Sossusvlei are the oldest in the world — red iron-oxide sand sculpted into forms that look like the surface of Mars. Dead Vlei, the ancient dried lake bed with blackened camel thorn trees, is the most surreal landscape I have ever photographed. You climb the dunes at 5am in complete darkness, then wait for the light to set them on fire.	https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNQ9ks-6HGPZ0BuZZQX1b1GU6jqcSgn9pV68nmaj4Hh_0f92AuHOWDJ029glkcMGHphAXEJBJJweBpSLtRsiuTVIZ8hF7R3H9es3kan_hbNE-p3Hgfk=w1200	49	["landscape","desert","dunes"]	f	https://photos.app.goo.gl/heJ7aXXZkKuNCkXN7	[]	\N	["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOU_iKvPkVzEy_tVLs1W5V7Xc7Zl5V38-6H9DYl6vakS5x8lDoHLFjWWf_uxJWah3qMZmuzJXyh7LXVIYg327ofncyGtZcHLT3foTJ2BjUaHOLLltiJ=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOZxYCt-pN5rPv7eyezU8lH8fNbthmv0iPCGUG19GIyY3D1KCvEkeLS-DokGjGN7ROAicDALzTJ67zDXj_JsQnZlSOia9OQgtIdYpeGAoiMRb49rtGh=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNNmNR3rUleifPBGiLa2iv7g-_2yxBfdTq_MlOKp5ruk9w6h2QhQgJbySSajEdwotulVTum_Oel28aqRQPLgsvNjvaESEfihY4nsT2bP73qAA_bGu9O=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMgCkmX94YVcJp0Ssx6FUMq07QtI_5dvbFAjBUtpsxT_4SuyojCtzQX-h2rRz3iCzMnWZCG0dO5w1VA0OAjo67vT0Ep8rQFf1iuM92KQrkmQDxUukJL=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMMcFHaJyZrNEIcGmqX1-Xt1q3hVoTH00C2lQN6t1FJ2xCr4sQEjhkzwU5JeRz4s6bgTApRrAKFOhXU-r2WoRQ-VwefmRcLRVQzv_F2XZUx5OYhv4OS=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP6Fz7kzNykkP1JQ8jSIwAS2wNCPVTru7q6jzn2fAQhp1_eoQMSYgPDbpIdjlnB3l2wVG3dCz1mMXy30UWG2-aY45ZXVYeTVCzbtPTLdKQuTgpOeSIw=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOx8QSrONBn_SDsMiJnn6tuce7BONctjnPXt7jehuNKWkHbaJnTxyBx-_t_RS7gDrK8JzFjYbwjJ_d48KtoRAm5S2Kr6L3d4Fw7_fDbCFe9JzSZciZw=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczO2RVupIIs08TfNJOUuntmRNUV538xUvpkNPotxbopqd_FuhTJRGL_6XG9QuThgN9sxcio1imloiYzDfLbjTulk3XxpHm66YfvZk3fYxOrSElYeSErb=w1200","ht