10	Bears of Daroji	Hampi, Karnataka	India	June	2025	The Simien Mountains are home to the gelada baboon — the world's only grass-eating primate. Troops of hundreds move across the escarpment edge at sunrise, their scarlet chest patches glowing. The landscape is vertical and ancient, carved by millennia of erosion into cathedral shapes. I camped at 4000m and woke each morning to clouds below me.	https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNECGG4Q0F4JWxDOeZdjWFP_gwG5W61Y9fJWf_gWL9sp9DGcXhVRM-jh_BYp1IJxmofPfC05FqJ3cK09jW3NtaBM4gx3o4FUbBe_EZxhg7G6tRcFdp3=w1200	18	["landscape","wildlife","mountains"]	f	https://photos.app.goo.gl/xZWYzwBS7R7yqW887	[]	\N	["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOJqBARgi_24mv8reLhwnlDel7hGH-uhJ3jceURELH7ttE2UyGVaQDtzrrmnPIWUzqF1FgFuZ9Ofwpc5TzSonQ4kFV5IFVcUvcdwarNbh16eRpd9IT3=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOqUjdnNH4NA6VdX7kQSqOhLAChTvcGns37rj3-34_3ABYjcgT6ijnKOZPkuYtl0Mn3Gy95Xo8WWX5An-PPRyoWEpPVyCRkhzZCBtEo4Fjr21IEQoJh=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNfLDmxxFB2DjfMWS8xBIbhKZmsbufQhp4xa2xRgo7ZeKbdS2PUBbWf9xduvyys-xFwDwqhiPxhLsIAiaJuhZGVyyBR0JntDps9b92kq9ZGZ_KQCPKk=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNUWLOTUpgB5JxynxbYVNOdjUz7SX9mGrInZwHMV7M-UnOziiO-aUiK9jfAZemPfQ_fPXWLVlOC60Ce3Glg44Y2ECOLerZVPn1Krh0DWZke0QvNvOlH=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPIJX9SVacGVuV9aCSPLSVTAxHfdx88pfdqVA5r_DB6SKNtVm286F_OdZ50Iw9VcZgNJFL1lR6x6g7C4u5oKE1RA4PVZpkXpIMRoJ_-G8rWV8lB5spf=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP7gSwNJQlapKI3BrtYcLzif8q5eSX55FRp9OHm6lM3_OZHpy95pKbhPc33-MM_kqJRHYAFzt4Vikl_oXUchL7oHYsQKyEIwrKfarrYq_7AghIjNx_k=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOXz24EUpWUCeW-AedIhkR6ViC7aO6_2v8-YUYQPEP-_ZY74trnuULyQRFiT2l65QSn2walqUGUDF5-BVE20eKwRY0kj_C41OmkbPN_Ph5nVpnOMr_A=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNgsZXshx510YnfoOFtHl29oYMbdzXxYFz2oCqnfJaTaZpARxkhDq5UC_Pkh21icCPN59yWF-qbnbhTLeNm1lht2ZvkmMWDhuXCoJeC36imhPanUMhl=w1200","https://lh3.googl