4	Kuno National Park, India	Kuno	India	February	2026	Patagonian light is feral and unpredictable. It can go from iron grey to blinding gold in minutes, then back again. I hiked the W circuit with 12kg of camera gear on my back, waking at 4am each day hoping the famous peaks would emerge from the clouds. On day seven, they did — perfectly reflected in the milky turquoise lake below.	https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOHFj9u4xKOfVZXe47DFjUR-fL7rvIxex-SLz9NLYLBoQrZvUH_RsNmZ5JscUGwgijztIhpsxJFqBYJrwTkyIsoSa2AqXoglKQyuiVXomrxYJYFL0Wp=w1200	35	["cheetah","india"]	f	https://photos.google.com/share/AF1QipO4awAegIbyjyUAleHwpySPANd33-aFAEl-rpc6KGMdayO_tDMGL1ZsQLs8f6t6ww?key=emZ0OGVSVnl6MF85QnZTbnE4elRaMGVvQ19zNnJn	[]	\N	["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOHFj9u4xKOfVZXe47DFjUR-fL7rvIxex-SLz9NLYLBoQrZvUH_RsNmZ5JscUGwgijztIhpsxJFqBYJrwTkyIsoSa2AqXoglKQyuiVXomrxYJYFL0Wp=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNkJfwb0dX3DCN_wrO9maTIzvy65ABqATKQH8yJU6zcYRXFzeSZ2mKr6b1-PTNTfM8byOBdz3NYSeva45HF1uGNiEX5fYCWP4RZ6Lv5Hb3LDN9IIAHn=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczO9pD5mmnECM4RAgo2qS6ad1NAzjylx8TLdrF09IfLa6-QHb-iuYnyA5hCyvrqsmu8Oo3fh71xlRaaJ3YGO5LIxNCoWQdBrueXDH7xkuBL5kvFzgl7c=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMoxmCwjDa2OjVif6UZewfUVPolohgP54mPKisTnmd8R57vyJ7oSAJwHfp692EDE3dClt-5mwPGoJkWhYd3PYuJ_AukbVSm7QV1YNKysjbg9WgzmDpK=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNzd8_57LiEt5Z3ZdEvbj0pZ77pUmc_7dsDVyufvE4OQzxFCIdzkXV1tr7JWVfEzmrETyHb7kRrBnyb3HwdeurbEB2zlN0-lLTiBAkK3IcqaL-eTqfl=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMVgE83kGJIBKzz8to67ujA6grkFSmYjkE4_t5JrtYk2a_k0nInVj_MKNmgtAbHl6Ss68QaBmQUZ8SUOuTJgVmjpY9zoIMQY3PRRSgCNIjjU1_kVh5i=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPrqeTfVZd5SCdO2nsXy7IVPAsf7Gg7enb7dR574GWHmlZ1zcDH0RcV0S98xVtzFyC7-4Yekh7Uf-Uzko6aQKaUi7khKcMi-q6NEeWsGhf2t1-bGn8H=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOA9QHLtWek_SzoT68pdIOq-pF4DI7kR3UBy_EhwRCFNGIRfDgcYA3B7PvGcbpgDFO