17	Pilhibit	Pilihibit, UP	India	November	2025	The Tibetan Plateau sits at an average elevation of 4500 meters — the roof of the world. The light here is crystalline and brutal, stripped of the atmospheric softness you find at sea level. I spent a month crossing the plateau by land, photographing nomadic Tibetan herders, black-necked cranes on salt lakes, and the enormous open sky that dominates everything.	https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPZ9RWLZiuKUcCrINzsEdo5pAfcu6jC0_KoGoUhNMQ80OOo0XzsAHqRY_FnaIBIqx6r0FWdRzzgKp-F4a6Kr7Lo9nWvb-BvXqq_n56Smn2lWfewI-0t=w1920	26	["landscape","plateau","tibet"]	f	https://photos.app.goo.gl/oZyL5mfMi9AajZU5A	[{"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPZ9RWLZiuKUcCrINzsEdo5pAfcu6jC0_KoGoUhNMQ80OOo0XzsAHqRY_FnaIBIqx6r0FWdRzzgKp-F4a6Kr7Lo9nWvb-BvXqq_n56Smn2lWfewI-0t=w1920","caption":""},{"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczM0qRg9zBB0JMJAmTCxoVqBj1bYIf8M02Gs_SO6YQrKz8fkZ7XBsMFgDtLeecgUrhcj1un64EqZm3fEIBBjkESx4lYUxpQzDMN2c5K99mpXYGOyl7G5=w1920","caption":""},{"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNgEUXJeqHr08QchFFVQh5sJ0H2OihOWHd3-7nPH-B689iNwnlyldp317yQVZZ_cmjq5afPwWLbXpJD1SOoVHrrmFi15jvyfT3dLb3Ve1qNLH13_ECx=w1920","caption":""},{"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNcQE1D2MdDdKeJYo3skACc5MaDNnLt5_v28Ri4cB7SmicvtnB6cC-Wqk_HlRBdtqBUQJb4TzKrlAEi-aMJTFLdlzVra-EngnATw_nFQj-3KWZuOFAL=w1920","caption":""},{"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPDUKVU7GARWgVBEvU5xqPAbXgVL7AOlS4kY-oCsFOu7PJ8ZGN0K1WLOtlFRIklWeUt6Dgd4yqeqbY_PArdNG7B8BhanmwujZ7XG-_1PR7cvK_yzRV0=w1920","caption":""},{"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPt_B21P6m-vkoJZxVWotIhJ9XIH1PrgQMfgdFal8AAYc0glEqPwEuKyTDeUyvQYVIwo4cfkPEYgLTbi2NvnSaqMWvmNtQ3o9Ptigy2nD4r-HbzleOJ=w1920","caption":""},{"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczO-MqZGmlMwOCm3e4G2SwbzJ8RxT9aVLjahJEgsKGkg0Q0385bh2wuLV9kjmRaLNuLNA4eBZeGt_7nOKpMgeOMQ8-yjnTXg-hPDsTtONnjtdKAUBByh=w1920","caption":""},{"url":"https://lh3.googleuserconte