11	Historical Hampi, Tungabhadra Dam	Hampi, Karnataka	India	June	2025	The Amazon absorbs you. Every direction is green, dense, alive, indifferent. I spent three weeks deep in the Madre de Dios region of Peru, sleeping in open-sided shelters and waking before dawn each day to photograph the clay licks — enormous riverbanks where hundreds of parrots and macaws descend at sunrise for minerals.	https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNzyytw9My-mk495ZNzcflppYIP4LFXzf0RTjuNCOpiNcVI9DRzIJupZH60LdLebtmXQ3bgjhyrlW1DKPsIQXvhMegyfs-xtlPuDJGV9mOATzXNXS1o=w1200	57	["wildlife","jungle","amazon"]	f	https://photos.app.goo.gl/yyCnSnxorVfXXN2GA	[]	\N	["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMrzpyYowKBEJkz-WuBMIWgxyO3ALcjsOktQ1BizSwsAjfCPZbftISv5E20DIlCKLrE0WFqbBO7QK4E_fToXaWDdkRDq9R4rLE5-ZHLwahJN0SlpIHL=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczM8Nevmx2f_jOjb95N77iN5LPVHZvX-LKNLeutHceJ5kqpd01YgBx3anJzsY2jXg7rrjUqhJD3Cb7v1HNAFAsvmsWkA1awIEW54tEiwdMot8lxHUkb6=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNYQ69j0RreldkX68BMyh3I_17ZugN5u3syztQLqXiE_BdcRh7nLKEK-l7JO7z6vjiqcwNHdUjB-lDtLJLLA_9T14JvwupJEEzXOhqHVwSGv_iKC6l3=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPvrOGvQHEd6paIN3zsbcyZ0ZYfgGoc6iHVzpMY7q80lPS-VHZaor-gA32pr2GpUD9gbXDnWofKzCD4AKZE5k8aEA9FvWfUyexdlUjpYVnx_FC8rq85=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMfWqHRuc3ob2gr1OGPdI4IsvZnI-6EcObsp5E0t-SQSJYJ5gQHGzHD9dVbtcXKSQHWJ3ve60tn8KRaS-0Z8w3HCzbWQfMD2cb1yQKMmVKnw-2dVtbY=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMMdsVlpc9gGB9JcU_2crtO4Ep3DSRDRFCv7fX6eVn1J7Fu2Fzvb3xIMcC_H3mVjE6gfKlSv4_NMd1pyjci7zYZ_DSz6sYZULT20ffnwxVrC1cc1u4h=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPlHos6SKjNCHtXwB3XptUk93r8K0KoiqeM1YHPNh2l-73I5MRLhHkE86atQKGpr1IVTspYWac_cA8rs1-4DhTDntKb7F-4oyjJQDOR4zerGHOyPPqs=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNfHYPMjTlst7Dqs5J2Txx96kuvnGg8OtaD1A6atfUgwHLm8M5GuSqANj1vmLWbfUJx3C-rvmGKB5-hqrHlBRiwYcagjMszI1wJny0nXqgYSB48f0EJ=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercont