3	Kabini Again 3	Kabini, Karnataka	India	April	2025	The Danum Valley rainforest is one of the oldest on the planet — 130 million years undisturbed. Pygmy elephants moving silently through ancient trees. Orangutans watching me from the canopy with knowing eyes. I spent ten days in a tree hide waiting for the moment a clouded leopard would emerge from the shadows. It did — at 3am on the last night.	https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMaUtfe0CJKYmhm681RJshtoRfI4hzcs8nWQY9wKkyewAyEQ9esShUffZl5qRrEVquocwosfRSt6tqus6bv5T_jlJjTpjnccbApExhp5B0cIBpHRZoO=w1200	18	["wildlife","jungle","primates"]	f	https://photos.app.goo.gl/zKB3jaYkoP4bAxrb9	[]	\N	["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMaUtfe0CJKYmhm681RJshtoRfI4hzcs8nWQY9wKkyewAyEQ9esShUffZl5qRrEVquocwosfRSt6tqus6bv5T_jlJjTpjnccbApExhp5B0cIBpHRZoO=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPCYLlwGmD44pHBxM0AWW4x7ks2ALbUGSK27JUuaxxjYmuLfCvIfS72e90E4YFJTespywN0i1kdCfGrbxemUjKcfERbfEa2QvyIxEE_3PLWV4qOL0VQ=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOvGcBBRREWXOiNhUt_ysEnRMSEC-nKEm3BCX_1Or5TJlOrcwtZOFOOms7D29FUR9teLM9ZTvsQKZT5p-apiT8wnHexTRbkBgVF1NtVWHVXJwLpQXiS=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNIl-qzHBgNQ1b_xDBFLY_nCwADvGXFThkjcON0A5cNY0ppqDELwOSDMcfMaO9tNfP6V6dAZjrbuoBqLG_JWfQ49qakmUVlTL4f0Ho4exaqkJHrA1_8=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOP10J4Es3XFs7wykkwX8T9WWHlLxDYC2n1CjdNMjvNduIy_m_iCo5sntvbGq0MkjPwncxt-j4jkvPCMKCMoP7y0w1dhOfo1_-cHrq0sFJX92Wn6Qxd=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPdURwf8I809kmu6lY_Aqj-d28g14Fsb2MhxHiBONxjTCPhgQswv8Kc6TMs-c_dScmYMvqojMZ7gpEp0KmuhKWs1XDxOAkW-k44DiHTzc_jJ1OiZAJY=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNRWzfOHhe8yfYxUTrDpoBOY8spTbhk6zkFD-LvC7WvTWwxxy_M4KMRFojgtxxsucaOe02QVMWZxdBXCGzZZwro32U7PLZ5hxh_7qH0dpbWRqDoV_Pu=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOdan0x6MJ2Z3aKAxEPcuc6DVPqLw6rB0pS-l3S3FBB9K9axmI6nR1Ukmm1akcqRwWK4B43Adx-6jPhV-4FPj6EZe1GhEc7SLlZ42Qx4HGxDk3M5tAU=w1200","https://lh3.google