14	Rare appearance of Red Phalarope	Dandeli, Karnataka	India	May	2025	Kaziranga holds the world's largest concentration of one-horned rhinoceros. The park floods completely each monsoon season, forcing all wildlife — rhinos, elephants, tigers — onto a narrow strip of high ground. In March, the grass is short and visibility is perfect. I photographed from an elephant back at dawn, moving silently through morning mist with a rhino mother and calf ten meters away.	https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPw5MsG07tQm5TUvSsJyG80_WHOIzdeIPjWzmZtCdXpInMH34JyVOSZ9JBbd-0s3OOX6Xd-okTfDPQ5W2SgrBjRXv7aE6IyBZC76F1b7IjRH-08rB2j=w1200	12	["wildlife","rhinos","wetlands"]	f	https://photos.app.goo.gl/WANFE2ppCGMCBmWAA	[]	\N	["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMexDB3bFEkAGERKmr7BQqTOydZV0lSwKbNkKHo1DgTR3vhN3UvfPSguZpACKlOakimX6SQGK0gpXLhA57pABp46xltwUpZxlvuW0-w3Wz7gHFNY8bQ=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOTxrbh-O8KHTjPyg_RiK1XSEo8RxHoSS-CJAy66Ffb9U5DP394JDVy6p1mQencPi9E1gSce-jogzf2zEy75AD351ma5KmWZSyKRuaWMb1PSVX6Pvle=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPUVTgwiPXwisaYHdLz9Oc93Vc_e-OS_aKBC5Wnr0dJR48tgwUXjEWUUc0KmnKJu0_OknsEDA72mTRTFxJ1A2RE4y3sozkx6Dc_Vc9Uf2TA-0yqog04=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOkdsTcrbJAUrvbn4FN63NOd3hyBbd9KainSWDcaHQE3wVLJPeDIlnGZpiUEw0Hi6_J2eRSs_68oyBEjetYC3W5NoMXKvUbkastC-rdiRo4cmkmztXb=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMYOQiUyhaiDKl3bF8GyXvKDKPr6dWJEEV0Hg_IDf09YWEnrfNVy44TzFS7BP3VR0WQRCQHJbgd-_epEVv6nyU-3DHjHlPOTOdE7gPh30IAzEW8nsXY=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPw5MsG07tQm5TUvSsJyG80_WHOIzdeIPjWzmZtCdXpInMH34JyVOSZ9JBbd-0s3OOX6Xd-okTfDPQ5W2SgrBjRXv7aE6IyBZC76F1b7IjRH-08rB2j=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMJb_y9Y6QQ1r3aU_lRcXfDC68qRTIRZ755RS9efZPyTocGNnsgK4KivyR57AYazeBi3fdTXopGscOY6ouZhKb90nwOHv24_ZeXkCCairSoRCat8616=w1200","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP1B7KJkEmGaY1dMFGuaysslt6V8uGUGOhfq-Pv0JchYw7pCpTgHVj40kDvg6heibhWAH7vXDAtS